<title>ISRAEL: Israel's May trade deficit narrows to $686 mln.</title>
<headline>Israel's May trade deficit narrows to $686 mln.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's trade deficit in May totalled $685.8 million, the Central Bureau of Statistics said on Thursday.</p>
<p>	     May 97    Apr 97     May 96</p>
<p>Exports     1,691     1,571	1,575</p>
<p>Imports     2,376     2,201	2,483</p>
<p>Balance     - 686     - 630	- 889</p>
<p>		 Jan-May 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>Exports	   8,490	  7,711</p>
<p>Imports	  11,975	 12,377</p>
<p>Balance	 - 3,485	- 4,666</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
</text>
